usage: atomic_6views_run.py [-h] [--raw-root RAW_ROOT] [--mapping MAPPING]
                            [--depth-root DEPTH_ROOT] [--require-depth]
                            [--output-root OUTPUT_ROOT]
                            [--output-profile OUTPUT_PROFILE]
                            [--output-profile-sha256 OUTPUT_PROFILE_SHA256]
                            [--flat-root FLAT_ROOT] [--plan-root PLAN_ROOT]
                            [--work-root WORK_ROOT] [--task TASK]
                            [--episodes-per-task EPISODES_PER_TASK]
                            [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE] [--expected EXPECTED]
                            [--resume] [--gpus GPUS]
                            [--workers-per-gpu WORKERS_PER_GPU]
                            [--max-attempts MAX_ATTEMPTS]
                            [--ros-port-base ROS_PORT_BASE]
                            [--nav-repo NAV_REPO]
                            [--robocasa-repo ROBOCASA_REPO]
                            [--robosuite-repo ROBOSUITE_REPO]
                            [--nav-setup NAV_SETUP]
                            [--native-binary NATIVE_BINARY] [--min-z MIN_Z]
                            [--max-z MAX_Z] [--manual-start]
                            [--allow-experimental]
                            [--robot-pose-marker | --no-robot-pose-marker]
                            [--robot-pose-marker-style {classic,game_arrow}]
                            [--robot-pose-marker-outline | --no-robot-pose-marker-outline]
                            [--robot-pose-marker-outline-width ROBOT_POSE_MARKER_OUTLINE_WIDTH]
                            [--robot-pose-marker-outline-color ROBOT_POSE_MARKER_OUTLINE_COLOR]
                            [--robot-pose-marker-fill-color ROBOT_POSE_MARKER_FILL_COLOR]
                            [--robot-pose-marker-length-px ROBOT_POSE_MARKER_LENGTH_PX]
                            [--robot-pose-marker-relief {flat,raised}]
                            [--sim-color-only] [--scene-event-index]
                            [--sg-event-index] [--sim-direct-material]
                            [--lazy-texel-decode] [--sim-direct-geometry-only]
                            [--keep-work] [--episode-id EPISODE_ID]
                            [--ros-port ROS_PORT] [--gpu GPU]
                            {scan,plan,run,work}

One-command RoboCasa G2 Full-Map F27 production from ORIGINAL open-source
data. The entrypoint itself discovers source episode IDs, generates every
missing intermediate, and reuses completed source-bound artifacts. It NEVER
depends on acceptance-folder snapshots or prebuilt flat/depth caches. GPU work
is launched ONLY by explicit 'run --manual-start --allow-experimental' in the
foreground. Pipeline per episode: source -> factual metadata -> 10cm GT grid
-> nav_sg GT -> 5cm first-frame preview color -> native Room/SG bootstrap ->
sealed native bundle -> lean F27 VisualGeom roster -> all 2Hz original GT
states -> native Room-bound dynamic snapshots/Islands -> native 10mm visual
deltas -> native 10cm/10mm dualmap -> F27 -> compact PNG/SG in user-selected
output tree. Official nav_sg is kept in a distinct process from PSM-WMA (both
use package g2). No guessed semantic on/inside relations or human
certification is asserted.

positional arguments:
  {scan,plan,run,work}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --raw-root RAW_ROOT
  --mapping MAPPING
  --depth-root DEPTH_ROOT
  --require-depth
  --output-root OUTPUT_ROOT
  --output-profile OUTPUT_PROFILE
                        explicit Stage-A output profile JSON; requires new
                        staging
  --output-profile-sha256 OUTPUT_PROFILE_SHA256
                        dispatch-time immutable profile file identity
  --flat-root FLAT_ROOT
                        authoritative frame.task_index/tasks.parquet caption
                        source
  --plan-root PLAN_ROOT
  --work-root WORK_ROOT
  --task TASK
  --episodes-per-task EPISODES_PER_TASK
                        default ALL episodes per selected task
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
  --expected EXPECTED
  --resume
  --gpus GPUS
  --workers-per-gpu WORKERS_PER_GPU
  --max-attempts MAX_ATTEMPTS
  --ros-port-base ROS_PORT_BASE
  --nav-repo NAV_REPO
  --robocasa-repo ROBOCASA_REPO
  --robosuite-repo ROBOSUITE_REPO
  --nav-setup NAV_SETUP
  --native-binary NATIVE_BINARY
  --min-z MIN_Z
  --max-z MAX_Z
  --manual-start
  --allow-experimental
  --robot-pose-marker, --no-robot-pose-marker
                        include chassis marker on final floor-top PNGs
                        (default: on)
  --robot-pose-marker-style {classic,game_arrow}
                        final floor-top marker style (default: game_arrow)
  --robot-pose-marker-outline, --no-robot-pose-marker-outline
                        enable gray-white marker outline (default: on)
  --robot-pose-marker-outline-width ROBOT_POSE_MARKER_OUTLINE_WIDTH
                        marker outline thickness in final PNG pixels
  --robot-pose-marker-outline-color ROBOT_POSE_MARKER_OUTLINE_COLOR
                        marker outline color #RRGGBB
  --robot-pose-marker-fill-color ROBOT_POSE_MARKER_FILL_COLOR
                        marker fill color #RRGGBB
  --robot-pose-marker-length-px ROBOT_POSE_MARKER_LENGTH_PX
                        marker front-to-rear size in pixels; all other
                        dimensions scale with it
  --robot-pose-marker-relief {flat,raised}
                        2D flat or subtle raised/2.5D shading
  --sim-color-only      experimental RoboCasa GT: F27 direct 10mm color, no
                        nav_states
  --scene-event-index   EXPERIMENT ONLY: 1mm/1deg scene event rendering +
                        compact v2 indexed Views
  --sg-event-index      EXPERIMENT ONLY: 1mm/1degree chassis, lossless SG
                        keyframes/deltas, compact v3
  --sim-direct-material
                        EXPERIMENT ONLY: eliminate 10mm color voxel and
                        native_color_only stages
  --lazy-texel-decode   EXPERIMENT ONLY: on-demand source texel decoding in
                        F27
  --sim-direct-geometry-only
                        experimental RoboCasa Full Map 10cm GT native Room/SG;
                        never RGB-D
  --keep-work           retain large temporary artifacts (default: clean on
                        success)
  --episode-id EPISODE_ID
  --ros-port ROS_PORT
  --gpu GPU
